<title>Gouraud-Shaded Rotating Cube — Canvas 2D</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: dark; }
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: hidden; background: #0b0e14; }
  body { font-family: ui-monospace, "Cascadia Code", Consolas, monospace; color: #cdd6f4; }
  #scene { display: block; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; }
  #hud {
    position: fixed; top: 12px; left: 12px; padding: 10px 14px;
    background: rgba(10, 13, 20, 0.72); border: 1px solid rgba(120, 140, 200, 0.25);
    border-radius: 8px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; pointer-events: none;
